      "description": "Performs a swift thrust, dealing Electro DMG to opponents along the way.\n\nWhen Cyno is in the Pactsworn Pathclearer state, he will instead unleash a Mortuary Rite that deals thunderous AoE Electro DMG. If Cyno enters the Pactsworn Pathclearer through the Elemental Burst Sacred Rite: Wolf's Swiftness, unleashing Mortuary Rite will also extend the duration of the current instance of Pactsworn Pathclearer.\n\n<i>\"This judgment brooks no choice. There is no rejection or acceptance here... We have both long been bound up in this conviction.\"</i>",
